    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 05 · Check-in analysis & replies\nClients submit the hosted **Check-in Form**. Claude compares it with their last 6 check-ins, scores adherence, sets a green / amber / red risk level and drafts the coach's reply.\n\n**Safety routing:** anything mentioning pain, injury, health changes, disordered-eating signals, low mood or wanting to quit goes to the coach on Telegram with the draft. It is **never** auto-sent. Green/amber replies go out automatically while `autoReplyClients` is true in Config.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
